        "Title": "You Only Die Twice: Part 2",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHSEA",
        "PublicId": "121991493864",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/theark/scene_magpie.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 543aa136-c28a-41c4-918b-f75702fd06b5).Image",
        "Description": "47, I clearly asked you to eliminate Amos Dexter &amp; Jason Portman in Hokkaido.\rYou told me you killed them both. You promised me you got the job done.\rSo what the hell are they doing alive on the Isle of Sg&#224;il?!\rPlease stop embarassing yourself, 47. Fix this problem now, and finally kill them both!\r\rDon’t screw it up!\r\rP.S. At least we have that helicopter you stole from GAMA. We’re going to use it to pick you up after you complete this mission. Wave a signal flare when you’re ready.",
